WEBVTT

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:12.810
Right there!

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:16.320
Th-There? Where do you think "there" is?

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.860
Hell if I know.

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:22.200
What are you babbling on about?

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.120
A-Assistant Inspector Oscar!

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:34.380
If you keep messing around on the job, I'll kill you.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.380
I'm... so very... sorr—

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:44.340
When did this place turn into a pig farm?

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.470
It's so good!

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:49.970
That pig woman...

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:52.480
Conditions?

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:57.020
Yeah, there's something you'll need to do for us if you want to be released.

00:02:57.020 --> 00:03:00.120
Come on! Haven't I done enough for you already?

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:02.680
With that cheap thief body of yours?

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:10.910
At least you <i>moan</i> with a
voice on par with Ayan Maya's.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:12.650
Ayan?

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.420
Isn't she that masked opera singer?

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:20.170
She's a dramatic soprano virtuoso.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.200
Her voice and performance were
said to be of the heavens,

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:29.180
but most of her face was burned away in an unfortunate accident.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:32.730
I heard it was the work of an overenthusiastic fan.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:37.730
Since then, she's worn a mask
during all of her performances.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:41.230
A mask studded with precious jewels.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.990
Its worth is easily equal to that of a small country.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:47.990
Oh? You've got me interested now.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:51.740
It gets even more interesting. That mask...

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:56.390
is supposedly a courtship gift from the ghost that haunts Gerenia Palace.

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:57.460
Cut that out.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.070
And so,

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:05.830
now we finally get to the real
conditions for your release.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:21.230
Are you sure?

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:25.330
Is it really a good idea to let
a thief protect Ayan's mask?

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.240
I don't think we can trust her.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:32.240
There's no such thing as a woman who's never betrayed someone.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.700
It takes a thief to catch a thief.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:39.130
While the maggots are slowing each other down, we...

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:54.640
Gerenia Palace is a vast, intricate building.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.890
Not a single person working here,

00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:01.400
including myself, knows its full layout.

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:06.320
On the roof, we extract honey

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.320
for the famous brand, Notion.

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:11.880
This is the underground aquifer.

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:16.830
It runs throughout the city,
but as you can see, it's dry now.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:21.380
Back when water ran through it,
people apparently called it the "Lethe."

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:22.460
The Lethe?

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:25.340
A river in ancient Greek legends.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:30.000
It's a river that can allow you to forget your past by washing it away.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:33.810
This is backstage.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.700
"Don't get caught in the shadows"?

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:39.890
It's referring to Gerenia Palace's ghost.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:43.030
The rumor is that he'll haunt you if you think about him too much.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:45.070
It's not just a rumor.

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:50.570
Gerenia Palace loves Ayan, its virtuoso.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.070
Darenzo!

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:57.700
If this Lupin III is planning to steal
Ayan's mask, then he's as good as dead.

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:02.420
Gerenia Palace, please forgive these greedy souls.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:04.720
He gives me the creeps.

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:06.840
Darenzo's our prop master.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:10.680
The stagehands tend to be superstitious.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.060
This is Ayan.

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:22.930
Hello!

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.960
They're performing <i>Tosca</i>, huh?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.080
Yeah.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.040
A romantic tragedy

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.210
involving a painter and an opera singer.

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:48.800
Lady Tosca?

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:53.180
Don't you think you should be heading home?

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:54.540
No.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:59.370
If I don't see him, I won't be
able to sing my love song!

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:03.940
Wenches! Where have you hidden the traitor?

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:07.240
Traitor? What are you talking about?

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:09.170
Don't feign ignorance!

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.410
Are you in here, Angelotti?!

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.510
Wh-What?

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:30.250
What's wrong?

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.660
It's too loud in here.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.880
I can't even practice singing!

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:37.510
Y-Yes. Actually...

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:46.770
Lup—

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:50.030
I've missed you, Mine Fujiko.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:53.810
I just can't get enough of these.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:57.020
You're after it too, aren't you?

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:58.530
Her mask.

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:06.460
Lupin?!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:07.170
Lights!

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:14.210
Oscar!

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.810
It couldn't be. The ghost of the opera?

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.440
I am Tosca!

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:37.820
Ayan?

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:43.080
Even the demon is trying to tear
me away from Calavangia?

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:44.960
Please, show mercy!

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:49.010
A woman who's loved by even a demon!

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:50.960
That is the diva of Rome!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.080
Lupin?

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.420
Is that how it went?

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:40.050
Weren't they improvising?

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:45.600
Hey! Ayan, are you all right?

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.250
What's going on?

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.000
It's the ghost.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.730
That bloody message is proof that the ghost is angry.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:54.980
That's it for Ayan.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.500
How are you doing, Ayan?

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.460
I'll be able to get up by the time I have to sing.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.710
Until then, have my stand-in...

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.050
But you don't have a stand-in.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.180
There's one right here.

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.380
Huh?

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:22.390
They're about the same size.

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.260
If she just wears the fake mask...

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:35.480
There shouldn't be a problem. I'll leave it to you,

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:37.030
Mine Fujiko.

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:41.410
What's so fun about grabbing
the butt of a cheap thief?

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:44.090
Don't worry. It's encouragement.

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:46.910
Listen, make sure you lure out Lupin.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:49.650
Aren't you putting too much faith in this woman?

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:55.170
I'm telling you, she's a great actress capable of hitting the high notes, even when she's not feeling much of anything.

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:58.260
Oh, was it that obvious?

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:01.550
Hey!

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:05.030
Here, Miss Ayan! It's the
headpiece for your next costume.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:07.300
Say it just like that.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.810
Oh, my precious darling.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.630
Why do you not come to me today?

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:18.820
Without you, my life is nothing!

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:21.310
She's actually pretty good.

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:24.450
When does she switch with Ayan?

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:27.280
Right after the curtain closes.

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:29.330
About twenty minutes from now.

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:32.780
She'll be lowered underneath
the stage through a trap door,

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:34.750
and then switch with Ayan,
who will be waiting there.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.890
They're going to switch using a
trap door where no one can see.

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:41.720
It's the best opportunity for Mine
Fujiko and Lupin to steal the mask.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:49.720
If she can't stop Lupin, that woman should at least be able to slow him down by seducing him.

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:53.730
The guards are already in position.

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:58.230
What?

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.560
It's not time yet!

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:01.760
Hurry, Oscar!

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:08.050
Hey, isn't this a little rough?

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:24.880
The ghost?

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:26.200
Let me out!

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:28.390
Let me out now!

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.150
What?

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:47.910
Ayan!

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.860
Hey, this isn't what we agreed on!

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:08.950
Move to the fifth taped mark to your right.

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:14.430
I see. He got us.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.860
Using a prop letter,

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:20.280
he had Ayan move to the designated point.

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:27.620
He made it look like her life was in danger when it actually wasn't.

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:42.650
In that case, the ghost of the opera...

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:46.220
Lupin III, I will definitely...

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:49.930
not let you lay a finger on Ayan's mask.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:58.190
Oh, my darling, I want to go to your side.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.940
Ayan is mine!

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:03.940
Ayan!

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:04.900
What's happening?

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.030
I won't let you do that.

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.780
That voice... It's Lupin!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.330
Bees?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.500
They're the ones we keep on the roof.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.210
Hey, where are you guys going?!

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:32.220
Ah! Ow, ow ow!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:34.680
No! You mustn't take off your mask!

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:44.140
I put a device in your headpiece which emits a sound that the little bees just can't get enough of!

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:45.670
Impressive, huh?

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.160
That's not Ayan!

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:49.820
It's Nora!

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:54.340
She worked as a stagehand here five years ago.

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:56.720
I... Darenzo...

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:01.670
Well then, I'll be taking that mask!

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:11.970
Damn!

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.390
You're not getting away!

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.440
Zenigata?

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:23.910
You follow the cloaked guy!

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:24.600
Yes, sir!

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:39.020
Jeez, using keys to unlock things is so boring.

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:41.460
You! Help me, pig woman!

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:43.750
P-Pig woman?!

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:50.010
Pig! Run like the pig that you are!

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.720
How about you stop calling me that?

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.330
Then I'll call you Spittoon!

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:55.020
Spit...

00:15:55.600 --> 00:16:00.780
That's what you are—just a place for vile men to spit out their passions!

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:05.770
Spittoon, you take that way!

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:10.780
You...!

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:14.880
Where the hell am I?

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:25.790
We meet at last. I've missed you, Lupin III.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:30.920
You're something else.
Is it okay to leave the mask?

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.830
The mask? I don't care about that.

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:37.140
I'm only here to settle my score with you!

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.350
Whoa!

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.410
O Zenigata!

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:46.350
Wherefore art thou, Zenigata?

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:48.850
Wherefore am I?

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:54.740
I am who I am because the blood flowing through my veins screams out at me,

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:58.490
telling me to exterminate the Lupin family.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:14.470
<i>Back when water ran through it, people apparently called it the "Lethe."</i>

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:15.990
<i>The Lethe?</i>

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:18.570
<i>A river in Greek legends.</i>

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:22.430
<i>It's a river that can allow you to forget your past by washing it away.</i>

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:50.500
As long as I bear the name Zenigata,
I cannot deny my blood!

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.000
Blood, huh?

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:54.180
Gotcha!

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.010
Lupin!

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:01.960
My next trick is a huge amount of chili blood!

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:03.930
Extra blood for you!

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:10.100
I-It's getting in my eyes!

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:14.350
Huh? Why did it lead here?

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:17.880
Inspector! Oh, you're drenched in blood!

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.070
What a decadent beauty!

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:23.370
I mean, no! Please wake up!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:26.250
Inspector!

00:18:28.510 --> 00:18:30.500
D-Darenzo!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:35.430
I'm sorry, but you found out the secret of the ghost.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:46.720
Th-The ghost of the opera?

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:53.600
Darenzo.

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:55.830
Ayan.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:57.570
Darenzo!

00:18:58.100 --> 00:19:00.750
Darenzo. Darenzo.

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:02.320
Ayan.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:16.450
There's a room like this in the catacombs?

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:21.020
That couch used to be a sarcophagus.

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:23.010
It's pretty nice, don't you think?

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:26.580
Y-Yeah, very luxurious.

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:29.390
Have you been living down here this whole time?

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:33.650
Yeah. We had to move here because so many people opposed our love.

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:41.740
I wanted to be with him, even if it meant losing my fame and songs.

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:49.670
I saw the talent of a stagehand named Nora,

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:52.500
and I nurtured her as Ayan.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:57.130
And then that day, I...

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:59.630
You burned your own face?!

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:03.850
It was a bit hot, but...

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:07.330
the flames of love are even hotter.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:08.260
Ayan.

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:10.550
It was a good idea, right?

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:13.390
And I helped Nora acheive her dream, too.

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:16.350
No one would bother us any more.

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:19.530
Ayan would continue to perform.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:25.030
You lived for love. I get it.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.340
But I can't understand how you could abandon

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:31.790
the brilliant lights of the stage to live in hiding in this graveyard.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.760
A graveyard?

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:37.750
The stage of love is the most brilliant stage of them all.

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:40.690
We have no need for this mask anymore.

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:43.150
We could sell it and move out...

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:44.570
Oh, this?

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:51.680
It's perfect to keep the fire going for the soup.

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:59.310
Oh man. The treasure got burned black.

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:00.610
Lupin!

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.820
Oh my, another guest.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:08.300
Would you care to dine with us?

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:13.580
Sure.
